<title>UK: EIB sets 14 bln peseta fixed/reverse FRN.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 14 bln peseta fixed/reverse FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banco Santander de Negocios.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    14 BLN PTA    COUPON   **7.28	MATURITY    14.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     LISTING    MADRID    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS, THEN 12.80 PCT LESS 1-YEAR</p>
<p>		LIBOR</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 1	   GOV LAW     SPANISH</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF PESETA MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
